        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer BB5000-500, 5\" x 5\"  Door Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLarge 5\" commercial ball bearing door hinge. Medium duty door hinge, standard .146\" thickness. Standard full mortise hinge with 5 knuckle design and button tips. BHMA certified architectural grade hinges. Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/bommer-BB5000-500-hinge_size.gif?v=1704354633\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer BB5000-500 Hinge Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer BB5000-500 Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>2 Ball Bearings for Smooth Action</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.146\"</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>BHMA Certified Hinge</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Non-Rising Removable Pin</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - Conforms to ANSI A8112 for Ball Bearing Hinges</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BB5000-500.pdf?v=1691094996\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer BB5000-500 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with matching finish machine screws and wood screws. For use with both metal and wood  doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually (1 door hinge)</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p>",
